  DTS:Description="Ingest supplier catalogue files (pipe-delimited .psv, ISO-8859-1, YYYYMMDD dates, TRL footer carrying a row count and a price checksum). Prices arrive in the supplier's own currency and unit of measure; both are kept as supplied and converted downstream. A checksum mismatch quarantines the file instead of loading a partial catalogue."
